ler matches. \n\nHopefully Amazon can continue the pace and beat out previous sale days.","translation",{"_116":117,"_118":297,"_120":298,"_122":299,"_124":295,"_125":300,"_126":-5,"_127":-5},{"_116":117,"_118":292,"_120":293,"_122":294,"_124":295,"_125":296,"_126":-5,"_127":-5},{"_116":117,"_118":287,"_120":288,"_122":289,"_124":290,"_125":291,"_126":-5,"_127":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w",1174,258,"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w",1320,457,"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w",1216,"多平台销售","py8qprbcdxai9zm4em8rh3r7o","亚马逊卖家如何在 Seller Central 修改 Storefront URL","原文介绍在 Seller Central 修改系统生成的 Storefront URL 的步骤：进入账户设置、Seller Profile，选择目标商城并编辑 Store details，在 Storefront Link 字段输入名称并查看实时可用性，提交后由亚马逊审核，通常需几个工作日。原文区分两类链接：系统 Storefront 链接（amazon.com/shops/YourStoreName）指向卖家资料页，专业卖家即可设置；Brand Store 链接（amazon.com/yourbrandname）需 Brand Registry 并发布 Brand Store。原文称自定义 Storefront URL 不会直接影响 SEO，仅便于分享和强化品牌。原文来自该机构，存在相关商业利益，并非独立测评。",{"_103":321},"2026-10-08T12:33:51.000Z","2026-10-11T18:46:08.796Z",[99,129,319,320,102],{"_95":317,"_97":318},[311],{"_116":117,"_118":312,"_120":313,"_122":314,"_124":315,"_125":316,"_126":-5,"_127":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/970789cc8dc348b1.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/970789cc8dc348b1.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/970789cc8dc348b1.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/970789cc8dc348b1.webp 720w",1600,500,"Cecilia Diaz","BellaVix","品牌","Seller Central","BellaVix · Amazon与Walmart运营洞察","ywfmcfk6w4ql10k4lbtqctzet","Pasha Knish 建议卖家停止将亚马逊 Listing 视为静态宣传册","嘉宾 Pasha Knish 在播客中提出，